# ruffs

--- Ruffs_AirStrike | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_RUFFS_AIR_STRIKE_DESC
raw  Ruffs calls a barrage around the nearest opponent, dealing <VALUE1> damage with each hit.
now  Ruffs calls a barrage around the nearest opponent, dealing 1200 damage with each hit.
  VALUE1  1200  -> 1200

--- Ruffs_Cover | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_RUFFS_COVER_DESC
raw  Ruffs throws down <VALUE1> sandbags as cover. Each one has <VALUE2>% of Ruffs' max health.
now  Ruffs throws down 3 sandbags as cover. Each one has 40% of Ruffs' max health.
  VALUE1  3  -> 3
  VALUE2  40  -> 40

--- Ruffs_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_RUFFS_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Ruffs' Super deals <VALUE1>% more damage and his power-up fully charges a Hypercharge.
now  Ruffs' Super deals 25% more damage and his power-up fully charges a Hypercharge.
  VALUE1  25  -> 25

--- Ruffs_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_RUFFS_1_DESC
raw  Supply Drop now includes a bomb that adds <VALUE1>% more damage to the drop and also allows it to destroy walls.
now  Supply Drop now includes a bomb that adds 72% more damage to the drop and also allows it to destroy walls.
  VALUE1  72  -> 72

--- Ruffs_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_RUFFS_2_DESC
raw  Friendly Brawlers have their maximum health increased by <VALUE1> every second that they are in range of this ability while it's active.
now  Friendly Brawlers have their maximum health increased by 40 every second that they are in range of this ability while it's active.
  VALUE1  40  -> 40
